{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v2",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "paris-metro-old-maps"
  },
  "spec": {
    "annotations": [
      {
        "kind": "AnnotationQuery",
        "spec": {
          "builtIn": true,
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations \u0026 Alerts",
          "query": {
            "datasource": {
              "name": "-- Grafana --"
            },
            "group": "grafana",
            "kind": "DataQuery",
            "spec": {},
            "version": "v0"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "The Paris Métro growing from 1900 to today on old maps of Paris served by IGN: Cassini's 18th-century map, the État-major map of 1820–1866 or IGN's map of 1950. Play the timeline, pick lines; every panel answers in the browser.",
    "editable": true,
    "elements": {
      "panel-about": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "",
          "id": 9,
          "links": [],
          "title": "About the data",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "text",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "**Play the timeline.** It grows a window from 1900: the map shows the lines and stations open at its end, the figures count them, and the charts fill in as it goes. Drag across its bars to hold any window, and click lines in *Line by line* to keep only them. Everything is answered in your browser (Chaski, DuckDB-WASM), with no round trip to the server.\n\n**Lines and stations:** Île-de-France Mobilités open data, [Tracés du réseau ferré](https://data.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/explore/dataset/traces-du-reseau-ferre-idf/) and [Gares et stations](https://data.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/explore/dataset/emplacement-des-gares-idf/) (Licence Ouverte 2.0, last updated 21 October 2026), read by the server through the gateway, which keeps them a day, and loaded into your browser once. Each segment and station carries the day it entered service; line 1 opened on 19 July 1900. The six segments of line 11's 2024 extension carry none and take the day its last stations opened, 13 June 2024. Lengths are measured on the ellipsoid: 247 km today. Line 18, not open yet, is left out.\n\n**Old maps:** the [Géoplateforme](https://cartes.gouv.fr) WMS of IGN ([terms](https://cartes.gouv.fr/cgu)), asked by your browser for each view: the 18th-century Cassini map in two copies, the État-major map (1820–1866) and IGN's 1:50,000 map of 1950. Cassini is drawn from 1:34,000 out, so the map stops drawing it if you zoom in close.",
                "mode": "markdown"
              }
            },
            "version": "13.2.1"
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-by-line": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "Kilometres of each line open in the timeline's window. Click a line to keep only it on the map, the cards and the five-year chart (the timeline shows it as a pill, with a × to let go); shift-click to add one.",
          "id": 8,
          "links": [],
          "title": "Line by line: click to pick lines",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "ubica-chaski-mosaic-panel",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "preaggregate": true,
                "reads": "",
                "spec": "# Kilometres of each line open in the timeline's window. A click picks the line\n# (toggleY), a clause on line in the metroFilters selection: the map, the cards\n# and the five-year chart keep to it, and the timeline shows it as a pill. This\n# chart keeps every bar: Mosaic leaves a clause out of the whole plot it came\n# from, so a second layer here could not show the pick either.\nparams:\n  metroFilters: { select: crossfilter }\nplot:\n  - mark: barX\n    data: { from: segments, filterBy: $metroFilters }\n    x: { sum: km }\n    y: line\n    fill: line\n  - select: toggleY\n    as: $metroFilters\nxDomain: [0, 30]\nyDomain: ['Line 1', 'Line 2', 'Line 3', 'Line 3bis', 'Line 4', 'Line 5', 'Line 6', 'Line 7', 'Line 7bis', 'Line 8', 'Line 9', 'Line 10', 'Line 11', 'Line 12', 'Line 13', 'Line 14']\nxLabel: Kilometres open →\nyLabel: null\nmarginLeft: 70\ncolorDomain: ['Line 1', 'Line 2', 'Line 3', 'Line 3bis', 'Line 4', 'Line 5', 'Line 6', 'Line 7', 'Line 7bis', 'Line 8', 'Line 9', 'Line 10', 'Line 11', 'Line 12', 'Line 13', 'Line 14']\ncolorRange: ['#FFBE00', '#0055C8', '#6E6E00', '#82C8E6', '#A0006E', '#FF5A00', '#82DC73', '#FF82B4', '#82DC73', '#D282BE', '#D2D200', '#DC9600', '#6E491E', '#00643C', '#82C8E6', '#640082']\n",
                "variables": "- param: metroFilters\n  column: line\n  variable: line\n"
              }
            },
            "version": "2.2.0"
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-km": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "The length of every segment open in the timeline's window and on the lines picked, measured on the ellipsoid.",
          "id": 3,
          "links": [],
          "title": "Kilometres open",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "ubica-chaski-mosaic-panel",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "preaggregate": true,
                "reads": "",
                "spec": "params:\n  metroFilters: { select: crossfilter }\nplot:\n  - mark: text\n    data: { from: segments, filterBy: $metroFilters }\n    text: { sql: \"coalesce(round(sum(km)), 0)::INTEGER::VARCHAR || ' km'\" }\n    frameAnchor: middle\n    fill: 'currentColor'\n    fontSize: 40\n    fontWeight: 500\nxAxis: null\nyAxis: null\nmargin: 0\n",
                "variables": ""
              }
            },
            "version": "2.2.0"
          }
        }
      },
